{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0b0d1a01fd17990c332ae6368155cbc59050e839b19c2ae2d6f94201f26ad399", "ja": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 仙台公演\n『Angel STATION』DAY1を無事に\n終え、明日に備える事務員たちの一幕です。", "zh": "UNI-ON@IR!!!! 仙台公演\n『Angel STATION』DAY1顺利\n结束，事务员们正在为明天做准备的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "60921b3ef07821653d29b7d2e4849e99df962b6880cd9bbb8c6f2675cf26d7d2", "ja": "ついに始まりましたねっ。いつもの劇場を\n飛び出して、各地を巡るライブツアー！", "zh": "终于开始了呢！离开平日里的剧场，开启巡回各地的现场演出之旅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "a0bd3f65b6527ef780f2767813060c251a13ab6226025ab3a5c19d798af9eace", "ja": "開演まで、私も期待と不安でいっぱいでした～。\nでもすっごく盛り上がって、よかったです♪", "zh": "直到开场前，我都一直既期待又紧张～。\n不过现场气氛特别热烈，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "45f3150f4f560fe36ad88d0a8513f214d396c1fc3aff59d8c914777ae818789e", "ja": "っと、いけないいけない。まだ明日もあるから、\n気を引き締めないと……！", "zh": "啊，不行不行。明天还有演出，得打起精神来才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "d6937a712cae92759f7914a33f6a5a565e52357605a29e97c067828dc80fc7d8", "ja": "さすがいい心がけね、美咲ちゃん。\nまずは初日公演、お疲れ様！", "zh": "不愧是个好心态，美咲。首先，首日公演辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "c7aa456b219fbd890838448f2385f05f17d206a03ccd47fc0c3aa96b3ee8be79", "ja": "あっ、音無先輩、お疲れ様です♪\nみんなのおかげで、とても楽しくお仕事できました！", "zh": "啊，音无前辈，您辛苦了♪\n托大家的福，工作非常开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "fe8f404e5401f8bf370a1f520c74d470a846a9c1602c136ae61e964dac970dbd", "ja": "今日の美咲ちゃんは大活躍だったわ。画面に出て、\n司会進行までしちゃうなんて！　もう影の主役よね！", "zh": "今天的美咲表现得太活跃了。居然出现在画面上，还主持起流程来了！已经算是幕后主角了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "646573a319818347cc2b4227dd9aad1e26350eacd6259fa7b1fe3d9b1063988a", "ja": "パーッといきたいところだけど、まだ明日もあるし。\n今日はもう一度、打ち合わせしておきましょうか！", "zh": "虽然想痛痛快快地庆祝一下，不过明天还有工作。今天还是再开一次会确认一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "6bc21ef239c78a6e53f9a2dc51284dd2c3345134959d15a381fffffe369885ef", "ja": "はい、音無先輩！", "zh": "好的，音无前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "1effa93fe31de1d89340e89143c5b00cfffbae980ded0df4eda1b4a37ad54b32", "ja": "でも、遠征先で働き詰めっていうのは、\nご時世的にどうかと思うの。というわけで……", "zh": "不过，按现在的情况来看，到了外地还一直工作，我觉得不太合适。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "b0cb622c920fa7b4c1cf06de804ca7ed194f33dc31746d212f28b1b6c59af7e7", "ja": "とりあえず、英気を養うためにも、\n少しだけ楽しんじゃいましょうか♪", "zh": "总之，为了养精蓄锐，\n就稍微享受一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "a31e3a2befb1842ca05329c0008f4105a0e9cb0b2ed9f5b92d9345645e05682f", "ja": "音無先輩……！", "zh": "音无前辈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "fe739f59707f86e9075d27cee6fa41b804d165bd60528b8b3dd96633afabdded", "ja": "さぁ、今日は先輩である私に、ドーンと任せてね！\n仙台名物はまだまだたくさんあるんだから。うふふ♪", "zh": "来，今天就痛痛快快地交给我这个前辈吧！\n仙台的名产还有很多呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_017_6thtour_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_017_6thtour_01_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "6c4bb5dbbff081c662576b4da87d0ca0b6653f2ef7e27660462662b97fde64d3", "ja": "はーい！　美味しいごはんを食べて、明日からまた、\nみんなのためにいっぱいがんばりますね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "好——！吃完美味的饭菜，明天开始也要继续为了大家努力哦！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
